\f0\fs24 \cf0 The code in this folder is related to Figure panels 4D through F. \
\
- Panel D: Data for visualizing the histograms can be plotted by running deafMovementQuantify.m This loads a data matrix that was produced by deafMovementBootstrap.m which operates on the raw neuroimaging data not included here. \
\
- Panel E: Same script for panel D, just scroll down to the second half of the script for visualizing the polar histograms. \
\
- Panel F: These plots can be re-created with deafMovementQuantify_refLabelBootstrapped.m which loads results saved out from two scripts: (1) deafMovement_computeMeanDistanceToAtlas.m and (2) deafMovement_compareToAtlasBootsrap.m. The former derives the vector between the Rosenke atlas labels and the mean face/hand ROI for each group. The latter bootstraps these face/hand ROIs to derive distributions from which we can calculate Cohen\'92s D effect sizes. Those two scrips operate on raw neuroimaging data not included here. }